- No external/pretrained language model downloads.
- No Hugging Face/SentenceTransformer/GLiNER/BGE dependency.
- Train-only classical/statistical representations and locally learned
  distributional semantics.
- Semantic clustering is primary; entity/context/topic lenses are secondary.
- v5.6.1 owns entity → context → evidence → relation → RCA → remediation.
- Upstream intent labels are pass-through only; no intent model is trained or scored.
- Ontology integration is intentionally deferred until an approved NORA/TM Forum ontology is supplied.
- v5.6.1 hardens typed relation validation, evidence grounding, entity precision,
  RCA/remediation linkage, multi-lens context analytics, and human-review exports.
- No BERT/Transformer/pretrained embedding weights are downloaded or required.
